                                "sense_id": "8f92ddfc-9547-3aa8-bab0-81a842823e1d",
                                "text": "Mine eare is much enamored of thy note; / So is mine eye enthralled to thy ſhape."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1dbe4291-9b21-468f-a421-1d55ee0199f6",
                                "sense_id": "8f92ddfc-9547-3aa8-bab0-81a842823e1d",
                                "text": "At 18 I was fortunate enough to receive an offer to study at Oxford University. I was enthralled with the exciting new world around me and tried desperately to fit in."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
